get="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其它类似工具有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1405" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-lambda&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Feed Filter Maker&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;siftRSS&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/716" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Grepfeed&lt;/a&gt; 等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/I9aWMh3RfPzk0adL7A3WYrqtoYvlKM2wNRwcJ4962Q-SHhtlNxmF5kCPZQlIBEpjjM9JBp1-AxuE0OJdjh8Pc9frqIbD2rdF2gbhpuFCM2QxKk7XPoeON5zdc_8Ac9naMz0wEhi6r3j-xyh4_b_rfzKOqMclU6VO_YE7pMvZiAZkTnCuuZSl4Pxj19kSpN2z7ScDcFmKofnNptCFwH4EJCNYpZ4gn6cvFkOBJK-GA6Q6kXu3eQUup1WbGZnrKvzbFAzJi2pOysz_Kt9KjNxwH7nmtpppCAR0ELvKnIJ67jp-GAAFUysRvvLl2Oes4dDyatk7--PunkmS-7Bon-X8OQ.jpg" width="800" height="252" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;五年前的今天，我提交了「&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;ALL-about-RSS&lt;/a&gt;」的第一条 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/commit/fbb01c3fa2279df9048f23d6cd52e7b04b9daa1c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;commit&lt;/a&gt;，以彰显 RSS 作为开放规范的多样性和生命力。五年后，该 List 承蒙大家托举，成长为了一个 RSS 玩家的乐土，有开发者来 PR 自己的 RSS 相关作品，有爱好者来纠错补缺，也有&lt;a href="https://rss.tips/#donators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;捐赠&lt;/a&gt;、加星、关注等各种形式的支持与助力。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://star-history.com/#aboutrss/all-about-rss&amp;amp;Date" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;5K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/forks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;200+ forks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aboutrss/all-about-rss/graphs/contributors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;40+ 位贡献者&lt;/a&gt;，已使 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR 序号来到 #100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢各位 RSS 玩家，也欢迎继续群策群力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/jGqql4e3f16xCtRyBYG9R-TX2O-tLER-HeZDw4_rWaBJlkBfbgJ_wT_AxYdFZjtLD4kmI1k0X7A60veUnpv0OS4SNFbnOS-DiO4pMKPair-BhWhRZrS5s58dXZB90Vcn-jUwLAb-4yjxjM5s9z928Dfp3nuHE8OnqvonwYrGtABF5wz6XZ_QjxVtjynCxov8xID4A_-nycWAODNVehszLC7PV7Qw-gScHi2kSvHpLPPC5SgV-UEJd97Rb8_Y9epqt3u0_XxVAbACZbj6ke6qkfXSwRHHyYJ0CA3EcJQ4qes_y-d3PjwLEvFbeuC2d4wZUHqp5HD79vfy2bb0WYxRSg.jpg" width="800" height="460" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:01:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1511?q=%23Android"&gt;#Android&lt;/a&gt; App 免费，主打长毛象客户端，但也支持订阅 RSS 和 Bluesky，意味着可以构建多渠道的混合 Feed 流。上线于 24 年夏天。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://fread.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://fread.xyz/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者自荐：&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者推文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/UmdExfanR8B2wAu-yITq7xHUJUjj2ykQx_UrwFcaibP3ulOjmkP8UJzuhnFlBUyh6eMgGCxTRyrGQGQrgHBV9585RerU2pW5gr0dlWnaC7hb0r6mP58VnHl7yqSG_y-4jy7sestnvqVWMvAuTrqf7VJm34gQxIcrShmIDV3HBeBtwXv4UXwKi3PA1KCoQWBLGLPDkaiLfnddEvPq-nJuQAnVivF6CbPJHzE9gBwQhKRLCX6UicJ0Uk3iv-qcNHtY2wnSqEpeBOfZCzSiCkSxZwvEd012ZZjEaP47QXPV8jgDizZciCSdguZyF58w528eOypCeGH84G0I0JzqzB9iuQ.jpg" width="800" height="285" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 12:02:50 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 #Mastodon 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23Mastodon"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#Mastodon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过数个为社交媒体时间线中的链接创建 RSS Feed 的工具（&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/377" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/628" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1080" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;），都没活下来。Twitter/X 的那些可能是因为受限于封闭平台，希望 Fediverse 且 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&g